          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "\"O'er the mountain toward the west, as the children go to rest, faintly comes a sound, a song of nature hovers round\" - Charles Ives  \n\nA comforting selection of sleepy classical pieces, performed specially for Yoto listeners.   \n\nSnuggle up with this soothing set of classical favourites, with grazing sheep, rocking boats, rustling winds and muses inspiring sweet dreams and peaceful rest.  \nArranger: Johnny Herford",
